cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Ladder, please cite it."
title: "Ladder: small open models fine-tuned for competitive programming"
abstract: >-
  A QLoRA fine-tuning and evaluation pipeline for Codeforces-style problems,
  sized to run on free-tier GPUs. Models are scored by executing generated
  programs against real test cases rather than by similarity to a reference.
authors:
  - name: "NiLabs"
repository-code: "https://github.com/NiLabs-Models/ladder"
license: Apache-2.0
type: software
keywords:
  - competitive-programming
  - qlora
  - fine-tuning
  - code-generation
  - evaluation
